Modified on 2026-11-14: Vietnamese theme port for Deskland Preview.
Browser themes, theme metadata, selected supporting scripts, new thumbnails
and Vietnamese translations adapted from the user-supplied Deskland-VN 1.0.2
community distribution (https://github.com/nhhoang188/Deskland-VN), itself a
modified version of Deskland. Its original modification notice is retained at
third_party/deskland-vn/NOTICE and imported source hashes at IMPORT.json there.
This port keeps the Preview C# host and multi-monitor engine; it does not bundle
the reference Rust executable or its Windows lock-screen implementation.
Changes include the shared world clock, renderer pacing, native host bridge,
paused-layout updates, Vietnamese multi-monitor controls and packaging.
